### AI Engine - Module 5 Test File
### Install "REST Client" extension in VS Code, then click "Send Request" above each ###

### ✅ Test 1 — Health Check (make sure server is running)
GET http://localhost:3000

###

### ✅ Test 2 — Basic GST Notice (Section 73 mismatch)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/generate-response
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "notice": {
    "type": "SCN",
    "gstin": "27AAPFU0939F1ZV",
    "sections": ["Section 73"],
    "date": "2024-01-15",
    "tax_period": "Oct 2023",
    "amount": "240000"
  },
  "mismatches": [
    {
      "field": "GSTR-1 vs 3B",
      "diff": "240000",
      "month": "Oct 2023"
    }
  ]
}

